    "overhead": "Publish per-repetition bench and wall ratios to production/debug_control, medians over4runs. Gate metric is bench elapsed: median counters/debug_control or sampler/debug_control >2.0 flags heavy perturbation and prevents treating the ranking as representative of ordinary runtime. Wall time includes startup and profile export, and is reported separately. No speed adoption or Elo.",
